{"id":"u-399bcb0c-1afb-45e9-bb21-a545554f71f8","src":"community","title":"Aesthetics Program • Low Volume • Upper Focus","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Q6oOO5-4-day-low-volume-aesthetics-workout-upper-focus","desc":"This program are for the rats wanting to look good but don’t want to spend over an hour in the gym. This is low volume. Each workout takes 30 min, and mostly hits upper body. Your gains won’t be as great as other ones, but to some that wont matter. You will grow (but your legs will lag). \n\nWhen spread over the week it’s on/off/on/off/on/on/off\n\nThis is tailored for the people wanting the easy way out - The program people think is the shortcut to gains. Those who want the beach body, to look good shirtless, fill out their sleeves and achieve that f-boy aesthetic.\n\n\n\nPlease don’t run this longer than 3 months. You’ll end up looking like Johnny Bravo and you will wish you had incorporated some lower back movements. \nRun a properly balanced program after a few weeks, unless you are a total degenerate .","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Women's","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":30,"joins":12,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-14T14:06:39.566Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Chest Focus","Upper Back Focus","Shoulder Focus","Legs & Lower Back"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}],"note":"Pick weight you can do 6 reps at. Once you hit 10 reps on weight increase following week and start at 6 again.\nThe last set is a drop set : Drop weight 15%-20% and hit up to 12 reps."},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Seated Wide-Grip Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}],"note":"Can do 2 sets instead of 3. You can also superset with the tricep accessory."},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}],"note":"Can do 2 sets instead of 3"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}],"note":"Can do 2 sets instead of 3"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20